    improve docs for execute-once WOH and execute service (#7108)
    
    This PR improves the docs for the execute-once WOH. It now mentions the
    existence of `#tags` for parameter substitution. In the execute service
    docs it adds the missing `s` to the `tags` because the code actually
    matches that. See
    https://github.com/opencast/opencast/blob/develop/modules/execute-impl/src/main/java/org/opencastproject/execute/impl/ExecuteServiceImpl.java#L369
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Use the execute-once WOH e.g. with `#{tags(engage-streaming)}` to select
    the first track that matches.
    
    
